 e horizon.\nThe Moon is 12° up in the WNW · daylight\, Sun +65°.\nTimes
  against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's ed
 ge: https://occult.alokm.com/jupiter-2026-10-06?city=Lubumbashi%2C%20CD
